# Prisci, abstaining, settled referendums and blood hunts, by the rulebook ("The Prisci Block",
# "The Blood Hunt") and zero-vtes docs/rules-qa.md (5.2, 52.9, 59.18, 76.6, 77.14).
# Sarah's Marek Hale is a prince (2 votes); Corin Vale is a priscus (1 ballot, no vote).
seed 5
seat S sarah
seat X alexis
seat P pieter
crypt S "Marek Hale" *12
library S "Open Motion" *40
crypt X "Corin Vale" *12
library X "Open Motion" *40
crypt P "Corin Vale" *12
library P "Iron Ward" *40
start

S> move S:uncontrolled:1 ready
S> move S:uncontrolled:1 ready
X> move X:uncontrolled:1 ready
P> move P:uncontrolled:1 ready
S> next
S> next

# The prisci block: each ready priscus casts a ballot in a sub-referendum, and the block's 3
# votes go to the side with more ballots; a tied sub-referendum gives them to neither (52.9).
S> political S:ready:1 with S:hand:1
X> pass
P> pass
S> resolve success "Sarah gains 2 pool"
S> pass
S> vote for S:ready:1
S> pass
X> vote against X:ready:1
log public Corin Vale casts 1 ballot against
expect votes 2 3
X> pass
P> vote for P:ready:1
expect votes 2 0
P> pass
S> pass
X> pass
log public The referendum passes (2 for, 0 against)

# Making a vampire abstain (Kateline Nadasdy 76.6, Demonstration 77.14): its votes are cancelled,
# cast or to come. Then a card settles the referendum at once (Fakir al Sidi 59.18: it fails).
S> political S:ready:2 with S:hand:1
X> pass
P> pass
S> resolve success
S> pass
S> vote for S:ready:2
S> pass
X> abstain S:ready:2
log public Marek Hale abstains, its votes cancelled
expect votes 0 0
X> pass
P> pass
reject S> vote for S:ready:2
S> endreferendum fail "Fakir al Sidi"
log public S ends the referendum: it fails: Fakir al Sidi
S> pass
expect action none

# The blood hunt: Alexis's priscus diablerizes one of Sarah's princes, sent to torpor first.
# The referendum is not an action of its own: no cards played before votes, and no calling card;
# anyone may burn a political action card for a vote (5.2). If it passes, the diablerist burns.
S> next
S> next
S> next
X> next
X> next
expect turn 2 X minion
S> move S:ready:1 torpor
X> action X:ready:1 S
S> pass
expect action other X resolution
X> move S:torpor:1 S:ashHeap
X> bloodhunt
log public A blood hunt is called on Corin Vale: the referendum begins
expect window polling minion
X> vote against X:ready:1
X> pass
P> vote for P:ready:1
P> pass
reject S> vote for card
S> vote for S:ready:1
S> vote for S:hand:1
expect votes 3 0
S> pass
X> pass
P> pass
log public The blood hunt is called: Corin Vale is burned (3 for, 0 against)
expect count X:ashHeap 1
expect count X:ready 0
# Back to the action, which its Methuselah resolves.
expect action other X resolution
X> resolve success
X> pass
expect action none
